  "description": "Loft conversion including the erection of front and rear dormers to provide additional accommodation within the existing dwellinghouse.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed front dormer, by reason of its scale, bulk and prominent position on\r\nthe principal roof slope, would appear as an incongruous addition that fails to\r\nrespect the established roofscape and pattern of development. It would harm the\r\ncharacter and appearance of the host dwelling and the wider streetscene,\r\ncontrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), London Plan Policies\r\nD3 and D4, and Merton Local Plan Policies D12.1, D12.3 and D12.4.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
